sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Company wallet
  participant API as API + private storage
  participant E as ChallengeEscrow
  participant IDX as Indexer
  C->>API: Privy bearer + brief + pasted/uploaded TS/JS/Python grader
  API->>API: validate source, language/runtime/entrypoint + score schema; private-store bytes/config; canonical SHA-256 commitment
  API-->>C: wallet deployment calldata + terms + commitment
  C->>E: wallet deploys and funds challenge
  E-->>IDX: ChallengeCreated(challengeId, commitment, terms)
  IDX->>API: confirmed, checkpointed marketplace projection
  API-->>C: publish only after indexed confirmation
